    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Reliable, innovative, and dynamic individual with experience in business analytics, AI assisted development, data analytics and user experience. Skilled in Python, AWS, and modern development tools, with a focus on DevOps concepts and leading teams. Quick to learn new technologies and committed to consistent professional growth.</p>
    <p>Currently working as a Business Analyst, supporting stakeholder needs through requirement analysis, process optimization, and data-driven insights while continuing to build technical depth.</p>
    <p><a href="/resume.pdf" style="font-size:13px;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px">View resume (PDF)</a></p>

    <h2 class="hs">Story</h2>
    <p>I started out building and making: running the brand and social media for a student club, publishing WordPress pages for IEEE CAS Bangalore, and learning cloud automation as an intern, with Ansible and Terraform on AWS.</p>
    <p>Business analysis is where that mix turned out to matter. At Fortunesoft IT Innovations I translate requirements for FinTech, Healthcare and Life Sciences clients into actions teams can build, and I still prototype and ship my own projects to keep my technical depth current.</p>
    <p>Two recent engagements show the range: an investment platform that moved a business off spreadsheets and phone calls onto one system, and a payments middleware that connects a USSD menu to a national instant-payment network.</p>

