      <ul class="hl"><li>Own requirements, Jira workflows, wireframes and change-request management on two fintech platforms: an investment platform now live and a payments middleware in UAT.</li><li>Align clients and engineering teams, turning open questions into agreed scenarios before anything is built.</li><li>Scope future phases with clients, from a mobile app to instant payments as the base for a super app.</li><li>Maintain the project knowledge base, including a version-controlled user manual and requirement documents.</li></ul>
